 "works": [
  "A March in the Ranks Hard-Prest, and the Road Unknown",
  "Adieu to a Soldier",
  "Out from Behind This Mask [To Confront a Portrait]",
  "Pioneers! O Pioneers!",
  "Song of Myself",
  "Song of the Open Road"
 ],
 "sentences": [
  {
   "text": "Afoot and light-hearted I take to the open road,",
   "class": "VERBATIM",
   "src": "whitman/song-of-the-open-road/p001/s001",
   "work": "Song of the Open Road",
   "work_id": "pg1322",
   "section": "§1",
   "para": 1,
   "gutenberg_url": "https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/1322",
   "pbreak": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Healthy, free, the world before me,",
   "class": "VERBATIM",
   "src": "whitman/song-of-the-open-road/p001/s002",
   "work": "Song of the Open Road",
   "work_id": "pg1322",
   "section": "§1",
   "para": 1,
   "gutenberg_url": "https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/1322"
  },
  {
   "text": "The long brown path before me leading wherever I choose.",
   "class": "VERBATIM",
   "src": "whitman/song-of-the-open-road/p001/s003",
   "work": "Song of the Open Road",
   "work_id": "pg1322",
   "section": "§1",
   "para": 1,
   "gutenberg_url": "https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/1322"
  },
  {
   "text": "Henceforth I ask not good-fortune, I myself am good-fortune,",
   "class": "VERBATIM",
   "src": "whitman/song-of-the-open-road/p002/s001",
   "work": "Song of the Open Road",
   "work_id": "pg1322",
   "section": "§1",
   "para": 2,
   "gutenberg_url": "https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/1322",
   "pbreak": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Strong and content I travel the open road.",
   "class": "VERBATIM",
   "src": "whitman/song-of-the-open-road/p002/s004",
   "work": "Song of the Open Road",
   "work_id": "pg1322",
   "section": "§1",
   "para": 2,
   "gutenberg_url": "https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/1322"
  },
  {
   "text": "You road I enter upon and look around, I believe you are not all that is here,",
   "class": "VERBATIM",
   "src": "whitman/song-of-the-open-road/p005/s001",
   "work": "Song of the Open Road",
   "work_id": "pg1322",
   "section": "§2",
   "para": 5,
   "gutenberg_url": "https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/1322"
  },
  {
   "text": "I believe that much unseen is also here.",
   "class": "VERBATIM",
   "src": "whitman/song-of-the-open-road/p005/s002",
   "work": "Song of the Open Road",
   "work_id": "pg1322",
   "section": "§2",
   "para": 5,
   "gutenberg_url": "https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/1322"
  },
  {
   "text": "I tramp a perpetual journey, (come listen all!)",
   "class": "VERBATIM",
   "src": "whitman/song-of-myself/p308/s001",
   "work": "Song of Myself",
   "work_id": "pg1322",
   "section": "§46",
   "para": 308,
   "gutenberg_url": "https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/1322",
   "pbreak": true
  },
  {
   "text": "My signs are a rain-proof coat, good shoes, and a staff cut from the woods,",
   "class": "VERBATIM",
   "src": "whitman/song-of-myself/p308/s002",
   "work": "Song of Myself",
   "work_id": "pg1322",
   "section": "§46",
   "para": 308,
   "gutenberg_url": "https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/1322"
  },
  {
   "text": "Along the ruts of the turnpike, along the dry gulch and rivulet bed,",
   "class": "VERBATIM",
   "src": "whitman/song-of-myself/p191/s002",
   "work": "Song of Myself",
   "work_id": "pg1322",
   "section": "§33",
   "para": 191,
   "gutenberg_url": "https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/1322"
  },
  {
   "text": "Walking the path worn in the grass and beat through the leaves of the brush,",
   "class": "VERBATIM",
   "src": "whitman/song-of-myself/p191/s016",
   "work": "Song of Myself",
   "work_id": "pg1322",
   "section": "§33",
   "para": 191,
   "gutenberg_url": "https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/1322"
  },
  {
   "text": "I tread day and night such roads.",
   "class": "VERBATIM",
   "src": "whitman/song-of-myself/p191/s081",
   "work": "Song of Myself",
   "work_id": "pg1322",
   "section": "§33",
   "para": 191,
   "gutenberg_url": "https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/1322"
  },
  {
   "text": "Was the road of late so toilsome? did we stop discouraged nodding on our way?",
   "class": "VERBATIM",
   "src": "whitman/pioneers-o-pioneers/p025/s002",
   "work": "Pioneers! O Pioneers!",
   "work_id": "pg1322",
   "section": null,
   "para": 25,
   "gutenberg_url": "https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/1322",
   "pbreak": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Through untried roads with ambushes opponents lined,",
   "class": "VERBATIM",
   "src": "whitman/adieu-to-a-soldier/p002/s005",
   "work": "Adieu to a Soldier",
   "work_id": "pg1322",
   "section": null,
   "para": 2,
   "gutenberg_url": "https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/1322"
  },
  {
   "text": "Resuming, marching, ever in darkness marching, on in the ranks,",
   "class": "VERBATIM",
   "src": "whitman/a-march-in-the-ranks-hard-prest-and-the-road-unk/p001/s024",
   "work": "A March in the Ranks Hard-Prest, and the Road Unknown",
   "work_id": "pg1322",
   "section": null,
   "para": 1,
   "gutenberg_url": "https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/1322"
  },
  {
   "text": "The unknown road still marching.",
   "class": "VERBATIM",
   "src": "whitman/a-march-in-the-ranks-hard-prest-and-the-road-unk/p001/s025",
   "work": "A March in the Ranks Hard-Prest, and the Road Unknown",
   "work_id": "pg1322",
   "section": null,
   "para": 1,
   "gutenberg_url": "https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/1322"
  },
  {
   "text": "Not I, not any one else can travel that road for you,",
   "class": "VERBATIM",
   "src": "whitman/song-of-myself/p309/s001",
   "work": "Song of Myself",
   "work_id": "pg1322",
   "section": "§46",
   "para": 309,
   "gutenberg_url": "https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/1322",
   "pbreak": true
  },
  {
   "text": "You must travel it for yourself.",
   "class": "VERBATIM",
   "src": "whitman/song-of-myself/p309/s002",
   "work": "Song of Myself",
   "work_id": "pg1322",
   "section": "§46",
   "para": 309,
   "gutenberg_url": "https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/1322"
  },
  {
   "text": "Allons! the road is before us!",
   "class": "VERBATIM",
   "src": "whitman/song-of-the-open-road/p050/s001",
   "work": "Song of the Open Road",
   "work_id": "pg1322",
   "section": "§15",
   "para": 50,
   "gutenberg_url": "https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/1322"
  },
  {
   "text": "It is safe--I have tried it--my own feet have tried it well--be not detain’d!",
   "class": "VERBATIM",
   "src": "whitman/song-of-the-open-road/p050/s002",
   "work": "Song of the Open Road",
   "work_id": "pg1322",
   "section": "§15",
   "para": 50,
   "gutenberg_url": "https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/1322"
  },
  {
   "text": "To know the universe itself as a road, as many roads, as roads for traveling souls.",
   "class": "VERBATIM",
   "src": "whitman/song-of-the-open-road/p039/s015",
   "work": "Song of the Open Road",
   "work_id": "pg1322",
   "section": "§13",
   "para": 39,
   "gutenberg_url": "https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/1322"
  },
  {
   "text": "Then travel travel on.",
   "class": "VERBATIM",
   "src": "whitman/out-from-behind-this-mask-to-confront-a-portrait/p002/s009",
   "work": "Out from Behind This Mask [To Confront a Portrait]",
   "work_id": "pg1322",
   "section": "§2",
   "para": 2,
   "gutenberg_url": "https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/1322"
  }
 ]
}